  "content": {
    "en": "Tremor is the go-to React component library for building modern dashboards and data-dense web applications. Built on Tailwind CSS and Recharts, Tremor provides beautifully styled metric cards, area charts, bar charts, sparklines, and tracker bars that require zero chart configuration headaches.",
    "zh": "Tremor 是前端构建现代数据看板（Dashboard）与分析平台的事实标准库。它基于 Tailwind CSS 与 Recharts 构建，将复杂的数据图表抽象为极简易用的指标卡片、面积图、柱状图、微型趋势线与状态追踪条，让开发者无需繁琐配置即可交付企业级可视化。"
  },
